{#
  VNV LIVE — DJ, Karaoke & Live Music
  ------------------------------------------------------------------
  CHANGES FROM PREVIOUS VERSION (see chat for full rationale):

  1. PRICING MODEL FIXED — the old page used flat per-event prices
     ($750 / $1,250 / $1,500 for DJ, $900 / $1,400 / $1,750 for karaoke)
     that no longer match the live store. The store now sells these as
     a single variable product, priced PER HOUR with a minimum:
        - Social & Corporate DJ Package        $220/hr, 3-hr min
        - Interactive Karaoke Party Experience  $250/hr, 3-hr min
        - Deluxe Ceremony & Reception            $300/hr, 4-hr min
        - Community & Neighborhood Party         $400/hr, 4-hr min
     Karaoke is no longer a separate duplicate package family — it's
     one of the four core packages, tagged NEW. This removes the
     redundant second pricing grid entirely.

  2. ADD-ONS CATALOG CORRECTED — matched to the actual 7 products live
     under the "dj-services-live-music" store category, with current
     prices and direct product links (previously had a vague "LED
     Screens & Lighting / Ask for pricing" card that isn't a real SKU,
     and was missing Moving Head Club Lights + Uplighting Rental).

  3. NEW "Complete Your Event" section — cross-links to the other 5
     store categories (Planning, Catering, Rentals, Photo/Video,
     Decor) using their real category photos, per your request to
     surface the rest of the catalog from this page.

  4. Every pricing CTA now has two paths: "Request a Custom Quote"
     (opens the existing request modal for bespoke events) and
     "See Exact Pricing & Book" (links straight to the live store
     product page, where the real-time variation picker and price
     range live) — so the page never has to keep its own prices in
     sync by hand again; the store is the single source of truth.
#}
{% extends "templates/base.twig" %}

{% set show_whatsapp = true %}

{% block styles %}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/animate.css/4.1.1/animate.min.css"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,900;1,700;1,900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
    --vnv-primary: #5EC6C4;
    --vnv-primary-dark: #4aa8a6;
    --vnv-gold: #c5a059;
    --vnv-gold-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #bf953f 0%, #fcf6ba 45%, #b38728 100%);
    --vnv-dark-deep: #0a0c0c;
    --vnv-dark-soft: #141818;
    --vnv-dark-card: #1b2021;
    --vnv-light: #ffffff;
    --vnv-marble: #f4f7f8;
    --vnv-text-main: #2d3436;
    --vnv-text-dark: #11181a;
    --vnv-text-light: #f3f5f6;
    --vnv-text-muted: rgba(255,255,255,.74);
    --vnv-text-muted-soft: rgba(255,255,255,.60);
    --vnv-border: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

body {
    background: var(--vnv-dark-deep);
    color: var(--vnv-text-light);
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.8;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    overflow-x: hidden;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, .luxury-font {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
}

.text-vnv { color: var(--vnv-primary) !important; }
.text-gold {
    background: var(--vnv-gold-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
.letter-spacing-lg { letter-spacing: 4px; }

.vnv-btn {
    padding: 18px 30px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    transition: all .35s ease;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: .78rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
}

.btn-gold-vnv {
    background: var(--vnv-gold-gradient);
    color: #000 !important;
}
.btn-gold-vnv:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(197,160,89,.22);
}
.btn-outline-vnv {
    border: 2px solid var(--vnv-primary);
    color: var(--vnv-primary) !important;
    background: transparent;
}
.btn-outline-vnv:hover {
    background: var(--vnv-primary);
    color: #fff !important;
}
.btn-ghost-white {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    color: #fff !important;
    background: transparent;
}
.btn-ghost-white:hover {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000 !important;
}
.btn-sm-link {
    padding: 12px 20px;
    font-size: .7rem;
}

.section-vnv {
    padding: 120px 0;
    position: relative;
}

.vnv-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(94,198,196,.1);
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    font-size: .74rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

.hero-live {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 92vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10,12,12,.88) 0%, rgba(10,12,12,.68) 42%, rgba(10,12,12,.42) 100%),
        url('{{ asset_for('assets/images/dj1.jpg') }}') center/cover no-repeat;
}

.hero-live::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(94,198,196,.16), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(197,160,89,.10), transparent 24%);
    pointer-events: none;
}

.hero-live-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
}

.hero-live h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5.4rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin: 20px 0 24px;
    max-width: 920px;
}

.hero-live p.hero-copy {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.hero-services-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.hero-services-row span {
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    font-size: .74rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.8);
}

.hero-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

/* Trust stats bar */
.trust-bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 44px;
    margin-top: 42px;
}
.trust-stat .num {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    background: var(--vnv-gold-gradient);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
.trust-stat .label {
    font-size: .7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted-soft);
    margin-top: 4px;
}

.section-white {
    background: var(--vnv-marble);
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
}

.section-dark {
    background: var(--vnv-dark-deep);
    color: var(--vnv-text-light);
}

.section-heading {
    max-width: 920px;
    margin-bottom: 55px;
}
.section-heading h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1.04;
    margin: 16px 0 18px;
}
.section-heading p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0;
}
.section-white .section-heading p {
    color: #566164;
}
.section-dark .section-heading p {
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted);
}

.intro-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
}

.intro-image-card {
    border-radius: 30px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    background: #fff;
}

.intro-image-card img {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 420px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
}

.intro-panel {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

.intro-panel h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.intro-panel p,
.intro-panel li {
    color: #4f5b5f;
}

.intro-panel ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 25px 0 0;
}
.intro-panel ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.intro-panel ul li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--vnv-gold);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 12px;
}

.services-bg-video-wrap {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.services-bg-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 120%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    opacity: 0.12;
    filter: blur(2px) saturate(0.8);
    transform: translateY(-6%);
}

.services-bg-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
        to bottom,
        rgba(10,12,12,0.25),
        rgba(10,12,12,0.30),
        rgba(10,12,12,0.25)
    );
}

.package-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
}

.package-card {
    background: rgba(28, 34, 35, 0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 38px 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08);
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.package-card.popular {
    border: 2px solid var(--vnv-gold);
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(197,160,89,.20);
}

.popular-badge,
.new-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.popular-badge {
    background: var(--vnv-gold-gradient);
    color: #000;
}
.new-badge {
    background: rgba(94,198,196,.16);
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    border: 1px solid rgba(94,198,196,.35);
}

.package-card h3 {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    line-height: 1.15;
}
.package-card p,
.package-card li {
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted);
}
.package-price {
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
}
.package-price small {
    font-size: .95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted-soft);
}
.package-meta {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
    font-size: .88rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.package-card ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    flex: 1;
}
.package-card ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: .93rem;
}
.package-card ul li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--vnv-gold);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
}
.package-card .vnv-btn {
    margin-top: auto;
    width: 100%;
}

.min-hours-note {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-size: .92rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted);
}
.min-hours-note a { color: var(--vnv-primary); text-decoration: underline; }

.music-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: stretch;
}

.music-image-stack {
    display: grid;
    gap: 24px;
}

.music-image-stack img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 26px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
}

.music-image-stack img:first-child,
.music-image-stack img:last-child {
    min-height: 260px;
    max-height: 260px;
}

.music-panel {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 42px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
}

.music-panel h3 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.music-panel p,
.music-panel li {
    color: #4f5b5f;
}

.music-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 14px 26px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
}
.music-list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 22px;
}
.music-list li::before {
    content: "";
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--vnv-primary);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 12px;
}

.addon-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 22px;
}

.addon-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 30px 26px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.addon-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}

.addon-card h3 {
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.addon-card p {
    color: #4f5b5f;
    font-size: .92rem;
    flex: 1;
}
.addon-price {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    font-weight: 800;
}
.addon-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    color: var(--vnv-gold);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: .8rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* Why choose feature grid */
.feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
}
.feature-card {
    background: rgba(28, 34, 35, 0.82);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    border-radius: 28px;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    height: 100%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(197, 160, 89, 0.08);
}
.feature-card .feature-icon {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: rgba(94,198,196,.1);
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.feature-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #fff;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.feature-card p {
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
}

/* FAQ */
.faq-wrap {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
}
.faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    padding: 26px 0;
}
.faq-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
.faq-item h4 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.faq-item p {
    color: #566164;
    margin: 0;
}
.faq-item p a { color: var(--vnv-primary); text-decoration: underline; }

.video-placeholder-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
}

.video-placeholder {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.04);
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.20);
    border-radius: 24px;
    min-height: 220px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 24px;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,.62);
}

/* Explore more services */
.explore-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
}
.explore-card {
    border-radius: 26px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(17,24,26,.08);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform .3s ease, box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.explore-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.12);
}
.explore-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 170px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
}
.explore-card-body {
    padding: 24px;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}
.explore-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--vnv-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}
.explore-card p {
    color: #4f5b5f;
    font-size: .92rem;
    flex: 1;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}
.explore-card-link {
    color: var(--vnv-gold);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: .78rem;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
}

.instagram-block {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.instagram-block::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -120px;
    left: -120px;
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(94,198,196,0.14) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
}

.vnv-studio-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #161a1b 0%, #0d0f0f 100%);
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: 50px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
}

.vnv-studio-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
}

.vnv-studio-card p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.vnv-studio-info {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

.vnv-studio-info i {
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
}

.vnv-studio-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 15px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.instagram-gallery-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
}

.instagram-gallery-grid img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 220px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 22px;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
}

.final-cta-card {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #161a1b 0%, #0d0f0f 100%);
    border-radius: 45px;
    padding: 90px 70px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
}

.final-cta-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: 10%;
    width: 360px;
    height: 360px;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(94, 198, 196, 0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
}

.final-cta-card p {
    color: var(--vnv-text-muted-soft);
}

.final-cta-note {
    font-size: .85rem;
    color: var(--vnv-primary);
    margin-top: 18px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    font-weight: 700;
}

.vnv-btn-fixed {
    min-width: 240px;
    text-align: center;
    white-space: normal;
    line-height: 1.35;
    padding: 20px 28px;
}

@media (max-width: 1199px) {
    .package-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .addon-grid,
    .feature-grid,
    .explore-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .final-cta-card {
        padding: 60px 45px;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 991px) {
    .intro-wrap,
    .music-wrap {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .package-grid,
    .addon-grid,
    .feature-grid,
    .explore-grid,
    .video-placeholder-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .music-list {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .intro-panel,
    .music-panel,
    .vnv-studio-card {
        padding: 32px 28px;
    }

    .final-cta-card {
        padding: 50px 30px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .vnv-btn-fixed {
        min-width: 100%;
    }

    .services-bg-video {
        height: 100%;
        transform: none;
        filter: blur(1px) saturate(0.8);
    }
}

@media (max-width: 767px) {
    .section-vnv {
        padding: 90px 0;
    }

    .hero-live h1 {
        font-size: 2.7rem;
    }

    .vnv-btn {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 18px 24px;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .hero-cta-row {
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .trust-bar {
